# Admin Console & Review Queue Dashboard

### Developed by Rituraj Singh

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates an Admin Console and Review Queue Dashboard using Python and Google Colab. It focuses on recruiter analytics, candidate review management, KPI reporting, and interactive visualizations.

The project performs data loading, data cleaning, analysis, visualization, and report generation using a sample recruiter dataset.

---

## Objectives

- Analyze recruiter performance
- Monitor review queue status
- Track candidate application status
- Generate KPI summary
- Visualize hiring trends
- Export cleaned analysis report

---

## Features

- Data Cleaning
- Missing Value Detection
- Duplicate Record Removal
- Recruiter-wise Analysis
- Company-wise Analysis
- Candidate Status Analysis
- Review Queue Analysis
- Priority Analysis
- Rating Analysis
- Experience Analysis
- KPI Dashboard
- Excel Report Export

---

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Google Colab
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- OpenPyXL

---

## Dataset Columns

- Recruiter_ID
- Recruiter_Name
- Company
- Job_Title
- Candidate_Name
- Candidate_ID
- Experience
- Skills
- Status
- Review_Status
- Rating
- Applied_Date
- Review_Date
- Priority
- Location

---

## Project Workflow

1. Import Libraries
2. Load Excel Dataset
3. Data Cleaning
4. Exploratory Data Analysis
5. Recruiter Performance Analysis
6. Review Queue Monitoring
7. KPI Dashboard Generation
8. Data Visualization
9. Export Final Excel Report

---

## Visualizations Included

- Candidate Status Bar Chart
- Review Queue Pie Chart
- Company-wise Hiring Chart
- Top Recruiters Chart
- Priority Distribution Chart
- Job Title Distribution Chart
- Average Recruiter Rating Chart
- Experience Distribution Histogram

---

## Output

- KPI Dashboard Summary
- Recruiter Performance Report
